<title>SWITZERLAND: Geneva Feb consumer prices rise 0.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Geneva Feb consumer prices rise 0.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in the canton of Geneva rose 0.8 percent in February from a year earlier and were up 0.2 percent from January, the city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				   Feb 1997     Jan 1997	Feb 1996</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   0.2 pct	0.4 pct	0.3 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		0.8 pct	0.9 pct	0.7 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)     104.6	  104.4	  103.8</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
